### ========================================
### SERVERS - READ (expect 200 all)
### ========================================

### List Servers - M2M Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}

###

### List Servers - M2M Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_member}}

###

### List Servers - PAT Owner
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_owner}}

###

### List Servers - PAT Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_member}}

###

### Get Server - M2M Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/weather-local-org
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}

###

### ========================================
### SERVERS - WRITE (expect 403 member)
### ========================================

### Create Server - M2M Admin (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "test-server-admin",
    "url": "http://test-server.local",
    "transport": "http"
}

###

### Create Server - M2M Member (expect 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_member}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "test-server-member",
    "url": "http://test-server.local",
    "transport": "http"
}

###

### Create Server - PAT Owner (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_owner}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "test-server-owner",
    "url": "http://test-server.local",
    "transport": "http"
}

###

### Create Server - PAT Member (expect 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_member}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "test-server-patmem",
    "url": "http://test-server.local",
    "transport": "http"
}

###

### Update Server - M2M Admin (expect 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/test-server-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "enabled": true
}

###

### Delete Server - M2M Member (expect 403)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/test-server-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_member}}

###

### Delete Server - M2M Admin (expect 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/test-server-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}

###

### Delete Server - PAT Owner (expect 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/test-server-owner
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_owner}}

###

### ========================================
### SERVER CREDENTIALS
### ========================================

### List Credentials - M2M Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/weather-local-org/credentials
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}

###

### ========================================
### SERVER GOVERNANCE
### ========================================

### Get Governance - M2M Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/weather-local-org/governance
