###

### Set Governance - M2M Admin (expect 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/weather-local-org/governance
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tool_prefix": "test_",
    "allowed_tools": [],
    "denied_tools": []
}

###

### Set Governance - M2M Member (expect 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/weather-local-org/governance
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_member}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "tool_prefix": "member_"
}

