### ========================================
### PERSONAL ACCESS TOKENS (PAT)
### ========================================

### List Tokens - M2M Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}

###

### List Tokens - PAT Member (sees own tokens only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_member}}

###

### Create Token - PAT Member (self-service, expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_member}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "my-new-token"
}

