### ========================================
### SERVICE ACCOUNTS
### ========================================

### List Service Accounts - M2M Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/service-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_member}}

###

### Create Service Account - M2M Admin (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/service-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "test-sa",
    "description": "Test service account",
    "role": "member"
}

