POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orgs/members/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "role": "member"
}

###

### Invite Member - PAT Member (expect 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orgs/members/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_member}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test2@example.com",
    "role": "member"
}

