### ========================================
### ORGANIZATION SETTINGS
### ========================================

### List Settings - M2M Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_member}}

###

### Get Setting - PAT Owner
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/org.name
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_owner}}

###

### Update Setting - M2M Admin (expect 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/org.name
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "value": "Updated Org Name"
}

###

### Update Setting - PAT Member (expect 403)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/org.name
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_member}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "value": "Should Fail"
}

###

### Get Limits - M2M Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/limits
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}

###

### ========================================
### METRICS
### ========================================

### Today Metrics - M2M Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/today
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_member}}

###

### Hourly Metrics - PAT Owner
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/hourly?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_owner}}

###

### By Target Metrics - M2M Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/by-target?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}

###

### Summary Metrics - PAT Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/summary?hours=6
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_member}}

###

### Query Metrics - M2M Admin (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/query
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "hours": 24,
    "group_by": "target"
}

###

### ========================================
### AUDIT LOGS
### ========================================

### List Audit Logs - M2M Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_member}}

###

### List Audit Logs with filters - PAT Owner
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/audit?limit=10&action=server.create
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_owner}}

###

### ========================================
### ALERTS
### ========================================

### List Alert Rules - M2M Member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_member}}

###

### Get Active Alerts - PAT Owner
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/active
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_owner}}

###

### Get Alert History - M2M Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/history
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}

###

### Create Alert Rule - M2M Admin (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{m2m_admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test Alert",
    "alert_type": "threshold",
    "metric": "error_rate",
    "scope_type": "all",
    "operator": "above",
    "threshold": 0.1
}

###

### Create Alert Rule - PAT Member (expect 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{pat_member}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Member Alert",
    "alert_type": "threshold",
    "metric": "error_rate",
    "scope_type": "all",
    "operator": "above",
    "threshold": 0.1
}

